promotion-app-icon"><svg version="1.1" id="Layer_1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" viewBox="0 0 36 36"><path fill="none" d="M0 0h36v36H0z"></path><path fill="#fff" d="M10.9 18.4h14.2V21H10.9zM10.9 22.9h10.5v2.6H10.9z"></path><path fill="#1967d2" d="M21.8 9.8l4.5.8 3.7-.8-8.2-8.3-1.2 3.9z"></path><path fill="#fff" d="M10.9 13.9h14.2v2.6H10.9z"></path><path d="M21.8 9.8V1.5H8.2C7 1.5 6 2.5 6 3.8v28.5c0 1.2 1 2.2 2.2 2.2h19.5c1.2 0 2.2-1 2.2-2.2V9.8h-8.1zM21 25.1h-9.8v-1.9H21v1.9zm3.8-4.5H11.2v-1.9h13.5v1.9zm0-4.5H11.2v-1.9h13.5v1.9z" fill="#4285f4"></path></svg></div></span><span class="docs-ml-promotion-text"><div class="docs-ml-promotion-text-heading">Edit dengan apl Dokumen</div><div class="docs-ml-promotion-text-body">Membuat penyesuaian, memberi komentar, dan berbagi dengan yang lain agar dapat mengedit secara bersamaan.</div></span></div><div class="docs-ml-promotion-action-row"><span class="docs-ml-promotion-action-container"><span class="docs-ml-promotion-action-button-wrapper docs-ml-promotion-no-button-wrapper" role="button" tabindex="0"><span class="docs-ml-promotion-action-button docs-ml-promotion-no-button">LAIN KALI</span></span></span><span class="docs-ml-promotion-action-container"><span class="docs-ml-promotion-action-button-wrapper docs-ml-promotion-yes-button-wrapper" role="button" tabindex="0"><span class="docs-ml-promotion-action-button docs-ml-promotion-yes-button">GUNAKAN APLIKASI</span></span></span></div></div></div></div><div id="docs-ml-header-id" class="docs-ml-header" aria-hidden="true"><span class="docs-ml-header-item docs-ml-header-drive-link"><div id="docs-ml-header-drive-link-aria-label" style="display:none;">Buka Drive</div><a href="https://drive.google.com/u/0?usp=docs_web" aria-labelledby="docs-ml-header-drive-link-aria-label" role="button"><div class="docs-ml-header-icon-container"><div class="docs-ml-icon docs-ml-header-icon docs-ml-arrow-back-dir"><div class="docs-ml-img-container docs-ml-img docs-ml-arrow-back-icon"></div></div></div></a></span><span class="docs-ml-header-item docs-ml-header-document-title"><div class="docs-ml-header-document-title-text">Tambahkan fitur 'Insta kill rake' Yang automatis m...</div></span><div id="docs-ml-header-edit-button-aria-label" style="display:none;">Edit</div><span class="docs-ml-header-item docs-ml-header-edit-button" aria-labelledby="docs-ml-header-edit-button-aria-label" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="docs-ml-header-icon-container"><div class="docs-ml-icon docs-ml-header-icon"><div class="docs-ml-img-container docs-ml-img docs-ml-edit-icon"></div></div></div></span></div><div class="app-container" aria-hidden="true"><div class="doc-container"><div class="doc"><div class="doc-content" style="background-color:#ffffff;max-width:468pt;padding:72pt 72pt 72pt 72pt"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span>Tentu! Saya telah menambahkan ketiga fitur yang Anda minta ke dalam script Rayfield UI untuk game </span><span style="font-weight:700">The Rake Remastered</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;ini:</span></p><ol class="lst-kix_list_1-0 start" start="1" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Insta Kill Rake (Weapon Settings):</span><span>&nbsp;Fitur otomatis yang akan langsung menghabisi HP Rake jika ia mendekat dalam radius tertentu (misal &lt; 25 stud) dan Anda sedang memegang/membawa </span><span style="font-style:italic">Stun Stick</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Teleport Tab (Tab Baru):</span><span>&nbsp;Menu khusus untuk berpindah tempat secara instan ke lokasi penting seperti </span><span style="font-style:italic">Safe House</span><span>, </span><span style="font-style:italic">Watchtower</span><span>, dan area </span><span style="font-style:italic">Campsite/Tent</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Chair Bypass (Utility/Anti-Troll):</span><span>&nbsp;Tombol/Toggle yang mendeteksi kursi roda atau kursi di sekitar tenda dan menonaktifkan (</span><span style="font-style:italic">CanCollide = false</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">) pembatas/kolisinya agar Anda bisa kembali berdiri, berlari, atau naik ke atas kursi tersebut seperti sebelum di-fix oleh developer.</span></li></ol><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Berikut adalah script lengkap yang sudah diperbarui:</span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Courier&quot;;font-style:normal">-- Load Rayfield UI Library<br>local Rayfield = loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://sirius.menu/rayfield'))()<br><br>-- Create Main Window<br>local Window = Rayfield:CreateWindow({<br> &nbsp; Name = "The Rake Remastered Script",<br> &nbsp; LoadingTitle = "‚è≥Loading The script",<br> &nbsp; LoadingSubtitle = "üë§Made By: Jepry_Jago112",<br> &nbsp; ConfigurationSaving = {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Enabled = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;FolderName = nil,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;FileName = "TheRakeHub"<br> &nbsp; },<br> &nbsp; Discord = {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Enabled = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Invite = "noinvitelink",<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;RememberJoins = true<br> &nbsp; },<br> &nbsp; KeySystem = false,<br>})<br><br>-- Create Tabs<br>local MainTab = Window:CreateTab("Main Tab", 4483362458)<br>local TeleportTab = Window:CreateTab("Teleport", 4483362458)<br><br>-- Table to store Toggle states and Values<br>local Toggles = {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;RakeESP = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;PlayerESP = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;ScrapESP = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;BuildingESP = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;FlareGunESP = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;SupplyESP = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;AutoSupply = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;NoFog = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;NoDark = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;InfStamina = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;SpeedEnabled = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;InfoHUD = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;InfStunStick = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;InstaKillRake = false,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;ChairBypass = false<br>}<br>local SpeedValue = 16<br><br>-- Folder to store ESP objects cleanly<br>local CoreGui = game:GetService("CoreGui")<br>local ESPFolder = Instance.new("Folder")<br>ESPFolder.Name = "RakeESPFolder"<br>ESPFolder.Parent = CoreGui<br><br>-- ==========================================<br>-- DRAGGABLE INFO HUD (DAY/NIGHT &amp; POWER)<br>-- ==========================================<br>local UserInputService = game:GetService("UserInputService")<br>local Lighting = game:GetService("Lighting")<br><br>local HUDGui = Instance.new("ScreenGui")<br>HUDGui.Name = "RakeInfoHUD"<br>HUDGui.Parent = CoreGui<br>HUDGui.Enabled = false<br><br>local HUDFrame = Instance.new("Frame")<br>HUDFrame.Size = UDim2.new(0, 230, 0, 120)<br>HUDFrame.Position = UDim2.new(0.05, 0, 0.4, 0)<br>HUDFrame.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(20, 20, 20)<br>HUDFrame.BackgroundTransparency = 0.2<br>HUDFrame.BorderSizePixel = 0<br>HUDFrame.Active = true<br>HUDFrame.Parent = HUDGui<br><br>local UICorner = Instance.new("UICorner")<br>UICorner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, 8)<br>UICorner.Parent = HUDFrame<br><br>local UIStroke = Instance.new("UIStroke")<br>UIStroke.Color = Color3.fromRGB(0, 170, 255)<br>UIStroke.Thickness = 2<br>UIStroke.Parent = HUDFrame<br><br>-- Title Bar (Draggable Area)<br>local TitleBar = Instance.new("TextLabel")<br>TitleBar.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 30)<br>TitleBar.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(35, 35, 35)<br>TitleBar.BackgroundTransparency = 0.1<br>TitleBar.Text = " üìä The Rake Status HUD (Drag me)"<br>TitleBar.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)<br>TitleBar.TextSize = 13<br>TitleBar.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold<br>TitleBar.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left<br>TitleBar.Parent = HUDFrame<br><br>local TitleCorner = Instance.new("UICorner")<br>TitleCorner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, 8)<br>TitleCorner.Parent = TitleBar<br><br>-- Status Texts<br>local StatusText = Instance.new("TextLabel")<br>StatusText.Size = UDim2.new(1, -10, 1, -35)<br>StatusText.Position = UDim2.new(0, 5, 0, 35)<br>StatusText.BackgroundTransparency = 1<br>StatusText.Text = "Loading status..."<br>StatusText.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(220, 220, 220)<br>StatusText.TextSize = 12<br>StatusText.Font = Enum.Font.Gotham<br>StatusText.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left<br>StatusText.TextYAlignment = Enum.TextYAlignment.Top<br>StatusText.TextWrapped = true<br>StatusText.Parent = HUDFrame<br><br>-- Make HUD Draggable<br>local dragging, dragInput, dragStart, startPos<br>TitleBar.InputBegan:Connect(function(input)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;if input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 or input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.Touch then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;dragging = true<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;dragStart = input.Position<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;startPos = HUDFrame.Position<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;input.Changed:Connect(function()<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if input.UserInputState == Enum.UserInputState.End then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;dragging = false<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br>end)<br><br>UserInputService.InputChanged:Connect(function(input)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;if dragging and (input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseMovement or input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.Touch) then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local delta = input.Position - dragStart<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;HUDFrame.Position = UDim2.new(startPos.X.Scale, startPos.X.Offset + delta.X, startPos.Y.Scale, startPos.Y.Offset + delta.Y)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br>end)<br><br>-- ==========================================<br>-- UTILITY FUNCTIONS<br>-- ==========================================<br><br>local function GetPosition(obj)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;if obj:IsA("BasePart") then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;return obj.Position<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;elseif obj:IsA("Model") then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local part = obj.PrimaryPart or obj:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") or obj:FindFirstChildWhichIsA("BasePart")<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if part then return part.Position end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;return nil<br>end<br><br>local function CreateESP(instance, baseName, color, distance)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;if not instance or not instance.Parent then return end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;if ESPFolder:FindFirstChild(instance.Name .. "_ESP") then return end<br><br> &nbsp; &nbsp;local ESPGroup = Instance.new("Folder")<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;ESPGroup.Name = instance.Name .. "_ESP"<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;ESPGroup.Parent = ESPFolder<br><br> &nbsp; &nbsp;local Highlight = Instance.new("Highlight")<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Highlight.Parent = ESPGroup<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Highlight.Adornee = instance<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Highlight.FillColor = color<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Highlight.FillTransparency = 0.5<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Highlight.OutlineColor = Color3.new(1, 1, 1)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Highlight.OutlineTransparency = 0<br><br> &nbsp; &nbsp;local Billboard = Instance.new("BillboardGui")<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Billboard.Parent = ESPGroup<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Billboard.Adornee = instance<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Billboard.Size = UDim2.new(0, 150, 0, 30)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Billboard.StudsOffset = Vector3.new(0, 3, 0)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;Billboard.AlwaysOnTop = true<br><br> &nbsp; &nbsp;local TextLabel = Instance.new("TextLabel")<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.Parent = Billboard<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 1, 0)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.BackgroundTransparency = 1<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.Text = string.format("%s [%d Studs]", baseName, distance)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.TextColor3 = color<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.TextStrokeTransparency = 0<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;TextLabel.TextSize = 14<br><br> &nbsp; &nbsp;instance.AncestryChanged:Connect(function(_, parent)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if not parent then ESPGroup:Destroy() end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;end)<br>end<br><br>local function ClearESP()<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;for _, child in pairs(ESPFolder:GetChildren()) do<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;child:Destroy()<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br>end<br><br>-- Teleport Helper Function<br>local function TeleportTo(targetPosition)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;local char = game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;if char and char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;char.HumanoidRootPart.CFrame = CFrame.new(targetPosition + Vector3.new(0, 3, 0))<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br>end<br><br>-- ==========================================<br>-- MAIN LOOPS (ESP, HUD, LIGHTING, PLAYER, WEAPONS)<br>-- ==========================================<br><br>local LocalPlayer = game.Players.LocalPlayer<br>local RunService = game:GetService("RunService")<br><br>-- ESP &amp; Status HUD Update Loop<br>task.spawn(function()<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;while task.wait(0.5) do<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Update Info HUD Data<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if Toggles.InfoHUD then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;HUDGui.Enabled = true<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local clockTime = Lighting.ClockTime<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local timeState = ""<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local timeDetails = ""<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if clockTime &gt;= 6 and clockTime &lt; 18 then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;timeState = "‚òÄÔ∏è DAYTIME"<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local hoursLeft = 18 - clockTime<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;timeDetails = string.format("Night starts in: ~%.1f hours", hoursLeft)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;else<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;timeState = "üåô NIGHTTIME"<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local hoursLeft = (clockTime &gt;= 18) and (24 - clockTime + 6) or (6 - clockTime)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;timeDetails = string.format("Day starts in: ~%.1f hours", hoursLeft)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local powerStatus = "Power Status: Unknown"<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;for _, obj in pairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local name = string.lower(obj.Name)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if string.find(name, "powerstation") or string.find(name, "generator") then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;for _, val in pairs(obj:GetDescendants()) do<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if (val:IsA("IntValue") or val:IsA("NumberValue")) and (string.find(string.lower(val.Name), "power") or string.find(string.lower(val.Name), "fuel") or string.find(string.lower(val.Name), "energy")) then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;powerStatus = string.format("‚ö° Power/Fuel: %s", tostring(val.Value))<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;break<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;StatusText.Text = string.format("%s (%02.0f:00)\n%s\n%s", timeState, clockTime, timeDetails, powerStatus)<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;else<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;HUDGui.Enabled = false<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;end<br><br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- ESP Refresh Logic<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ClearESP()<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local lpChar = LocalPlayer.Character<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;local lpRoot = lpChar and lpChar:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")<br><br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if lpRoot then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;if Toggles.PlayerESP then<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;for _, player in pairs(game.Players:GetPlayers()) do<br> &nb